WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:04.920
Yes, may I help you?

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:07.160
I used to live here.

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:09.800
Won't you come in?

00:00:09.808 --> 00:00:12.000
It's the least I can do.

00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:14.520
Is it like you remember?

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:15.460
Cleaner.

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:17.400
Well, you feel free to look around,

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:19.660
while I get the water boiling.

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:22.680
"Your hair is winter fire...

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:24.360
...January embers."

00:00:24.980 --> 00:00:26.980
"My heart burns there, too."

00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:38.280
There you go.
Thank you.

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:39.579
Now, some music.

00:00:42.760 --> 00:00:43.420
There.

00:00:43.700 --> 00:00:45.420
I do apologize.

00:00:45.820 --> 00:00:49.380
It gets so very hot here this time of year.

00:00:49.740 --> 00:00:50.440
It's fine.

00:00:50.760 --> 00:00:54.120
Well, you feel like you could just about die.

00:00:55.100 --> 00:00:58.532
But you know what they say about Derry?

00:00:58.540 --> 00:00:59.032
Hmm?

00:00:59.380 --> 00:01:02.960
No one who dies here ever really dies.

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:18.540
But tell me, how is it being back in Derry?

00:01:19.140 --> 00:01:21.140
It's good. Strange.

00:01:21.520 --> 00:01:23.098
Strange?

00:01:23.098 --> 00:01:24.479
Oh, my!

00:01:27.370 --> 00:01:30.454
I had some cookies in the oven before you came.

00:01:30.454 --> 00:01:31.589
Stay right there.

00:01:31.589 --> 00:01:32.920
I shouldn't impose.
I'm gonna...

00:01:32.920 --> 00:01:34.960
No, no, ...
I insist.

00:01:36.380 --> 00:01:37.900
Your photos are lovely, Mrs. Kersh.

00:01:37.907 --> 00:01:39.243
Are these your family?

00:01:39.243 --> 00:01:41.300
My father came to this country

00:01:41.300 --> 00:01:43.560
with $14 in his pocket.

00:01:43.560 --> 00:01:45.440
What did he do, Mrs. Kersh?

00:01:45.640 --> 00:01:48.320
My father joined the circus.

00:02:02.820 --> 00:02:05.540
I was always daddy's little girl.

00:02:05.820 --> 00:02:07.235
What about you?

00:02:08.240 --> 00:02:11.200
Are you still his little girl, Beverly?

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:14.320
Are you?

00:02:21.840 --> 00:02:24.560
This meeting of the Losers' Club has officially begun.

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:29.680
We can do this, but we have to stick together.

